---
const title = "教战初集";
const description = "一个人约20年思维流动之复现与研究";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />

    <style>
      :global(*) {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      :global(html) {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      :global(body) {
        margin: 0;
        background: #f7f6f2;
        color: #171717;
        font-family:
          Georgia,
          "Times New Roman",
          "Noto Serif SC",
          "Songti SC",
          "SimSun",
          serif;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      :global(a) {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 48px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      header {
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d8d6d0;
      }

      .nav {
        min-height: 72px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 20px;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 28px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #555;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: #111;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 650px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 100px 0;
      }

      .hero-inner {
        max-width: 820px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        font-size: 13px;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        color: #777;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(58px, 9vw, 108px);
        font-weight: 400;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      .subtitle {
        margin-top: 32px;
        font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px);
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #333;
      }

      .intro {
        margin-top: 34px;
        max-width: 650px;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #666;
      }

      .hero-rule {
        width: 80px;
        margin-top: 48px;
        border: 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #222;
      }

      section {
        padding: 110px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #d8d6d0;
      }

      .section-title {
        margin-bottom: 45px;
        font-size: 14px;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        color: #777;
      }

      .work {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
        gap: 50px;
        padding: 35px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #d8d6d0;
      }

      .work:last-child {
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d8d6d0;
      }

      .work-number {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #888;
      }

      .work h2 {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        font-size: 30px;
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .work p {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin: 0;
        color: #666;
      }

      .quote {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .quote p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 38px);
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .quote small {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 30px;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .about {
        max-width: 760px;
      }

      .about p {
        font-size: 17px;
        color: #444;
      }

      footer {
        padding: 50px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #d8d6d0;
        color: #888;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 700px) {
        .container {
          width: min(100% - 32px, 1080px);
        }

        .nav {
          min-height: 64px;
        }

        .nav-links {
          gap: 14px;
          font-size: 12px;
        }

        .hero {
          min-height: 580px;
          padding: 70px 0;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 58px;
        }

        .work {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 10px;
        }

        section {
          padding: 75px 0;
        }

        .footer-inner {
          flex-direction: column;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container nav">
        <a href="/" class="logo">教战初集</a>

        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a href="#works">作品</a>
          <a href="#about">关于</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="hero-inner">
            <div class="eyebrow">PRIVATE RECORD · FIRST COLLECTION</div>

            <h1>教战初集</h1>

            <div class="subtitle">
              一个人约20年思维流动之复现与研究
            </div>

            <p class="intro">
              记录一个普通人在环境、现实、历史与自身之间所经历的选择。
              尽量还原当时所面对之状况、判断、决心、处置与代价。
            </p>

            <hr class="hero-rule" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="works">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-title">作品 / WORKS</div>

          <article class="work">
            <div class="work-number">01 / 主要作品</div>

            <div>
              <h2>
                <a href="/jiaozhan/">《教战初集》</a>
              </h2>

              <p>
                一份关于个人成长、思想形成、历史记忆、人生选择与现实处境的记录。
                自己约20年思维流动之复现与研究
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="work">
            <div class="work-number">02 / 战史</div>

            <div>
              <h2>战史研究</h2>

              <p>
                戡乱剿匪战史
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="work">
            <div class="work-number">03 / 随笔</div>

            <div>
              <h2>其他文字</h2>

              <p>
                关于历史、社会、个人选择以及一些尚未归入其他类别的思考。
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="container">
          <div class="quote">
            <p>
              “作战需步步求生，而存心必时时可死。”
            </p>

            <small>—— 张灵甫</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-title">关于 / ABOUT</div>

          <div class="about">
            <p>
              这个网站首先是一份个人档案与研究记录。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="container footer-inner">
        <span>教战初集</span>
        <span>Personal Archive</span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
